#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:106
msgid "If the pair style is not one the engine can produce, it is replaced by the engine's default and the replacement is written in the workchain report. With ``META``, leaving ``potential_pair_style`` unset therefore gives ``metatomic``; setting it explicitly is clearer."
msgstr "Se il pair style nol è un di chei che il motôr al pues produsi, al ven sostituît cul predefinît dal motôr e la sostituzion e ven scrite tal report de workchain. Cun ``META``, lassâ ``potential_pair_style`` cence valôr al da duncje ``metatomic``; impostâlu in mût esplicit al è plui clâr."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:121
msgid "The training itself is configured with a dictionary in the native format of the engine: ``training.mace.train.mace_config`` (see `examples/graphene/mace_config.yml <https://github.com/aiida-trieste-developers/aiida-trainspot/blob/main/examples/graphene/mace_config.yml>`_) or ``training.meta.train.meta_config`` (see `examples/graphene/meta_config.yml <https://github.com/aiida-trieste-developers/aiida-trainspot/blob/main/examples/graphene/meta_config.yml>`_). A complete metatrain run is `examples/graphene/run_atp_meta.py <https://github.com/aiida-trieste-developers/aiida-trainspot/blob/main/examples/graphene/run_atp_meta.py>`_."
msgstr "L'adestrament stes si lu configure cuntun dizionari tal formât natîf dal motôr: ``training.mace.train.mace_config`` (cjale `examples/graphene/mace_config.yml <https://github.com/aiida-trieste-developers/aiida-trainspot/blob/main/examples/graphene/mace_config.yml>`_) o ``training.meta.train.meta_config`` (cjale `examples/graphene/meta_config.yml <https://github.com/aiida-trieste-developers/aiida-trainspot/blob/main/examples/graphene/meta_config.yml>`_). Une esecuzion metatrain complete e je `examples/graphene/run_atp_meta.py <https://github.com/aiida-trieste-developers/aiida-trainspot/blob/main/examples/graphene/run_atp_meta.py>`_."

