msgstr "``True`` al ridûs la aumentazion dal dataset a dimensions di prove. Predefinît: ``False``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:160
msgid "The arguments that select protocols are the ones to decide on first for a production run. The default ab initio protocol is the most accurate one, and the ``fast`` protocol of the first run is meant for tests only. ``get_builder`` also sets one default MD run (300 K, ``nvt``, 50 steps), to be replaced for production; see :ref:`stage-explore`."
msgstr "I argoments che a sielzin i protocoi a son i prins di decidi par une esecuzion di produzion. Il protocol ab initio predefinît al è il plui precîs, e il protocol ``fast`` de prime esecuzion al è pensât dome pes provis. ``get_builder`` al impueste ancje une esecuzion MD predefinide (300 K, ``nvt``, 50 pas), di sostituî pe produzion; cjale :ref:`stage-explore`."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:166
msgid "A longer configuration"
msgstr "Une configurazion plui lungje"

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:168
msgid "The script below puts these pieces together for a longer run. It reuses ``set_scheduler`` from above, and, compared with the first-run script, it uses the default (``stringent``) ab initio protocol, the DFT-D2 correction in the MD, longer MD runs at two temperatures, a larger committee and explicit selection thresholds. It trains four potentials with MACE, explores two temperatures with ``npt`` dynamics, and keeps the default augmentation."
msgstr "Il script chi sot al met adun chescj tocs par une esecuzion plui lungje. Al torne a doprâ ``set_scheduler`` di parsore e, rispiet al script de prime esecuzion, al dopre il protocol ab initio predefinît (``stringent``), la corezion DFT-D2 te MD, esecuzions MD plui lungjis a dôs temperaduris, un comitât plui grant e limits di selezion esplicits. Al adestre cuatri potenziâi cun MACE, al esplore dôs temperaduris cun dinamiche ``npt`` e al ten la aumentazion predefinide."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:242
msgid "The example script ``examples/graphene/run_atp.py`` also uses a few options that depend on the cluster and the codes:"
msgstr "Il script di esempli ``examples/graphene/run_atp.py`` al dopre ancje cualchi opzion che e dipent dal cluster e dai codiçs:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:245
msgid "``builder.training.mace.train.metadata.options.prepend_text`` defines a ``mace_run_train`` shell function that launches the training through ``srun``, for training on multiple GPUs."
msgstr "``builder.training.mace.train.metadata.options.prepend_text`` al definìs une funzion di shell ``mace_run_train`` che e invie l'adestrament traviers di ``srun``, par adestrâ su plui GPU."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:247
msgid "``builder.exploration.md.lammps.settings = Dict({\"additional_cmdline_params\": [\"-k\", \"on\", \"g\", \"1\", \"-sf\", \"kk\"]})`` runs LAMMPS with the Kokkos GPU package."
msgstr "``builder.exploration.md.lammps.settings = Dict({\"additional_cmdline_params\": [\"-k\", \"on\", \"g\", \"1\", \"-sf\", \"kk\"]})`` al fâs zirâ LAMMPS cul pachet GPU Kokkos."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:249
msgid "``builder.ab_initio_labelling.quantumespresso.pw.metadata.options.withmpi = True`` runs ``pw.x`` under ``mpirun``."
msgstr "``builder.ab_initio_labelling.quantumespresso.pw.metadata.options.withmpi = True`` al fâs zirâ ``pw.x`` sot ``mpirun``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:255
msgid "Resuming a run"
msgstr "Ripiâ une esecuzion"

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:257
msgid "Production runs are long, and a run can stop because of a failed job or an exhausted allocation, or simply because more loops are wanted once the first ones are examined. Instead of starting over, ``get_builder_resume`` creates a builder from a previous run:"
msgstr "Lis esecuzions di produzion a son lungjis, e une esecuzion si pues fermâ par vie di un lavôr falît o di une assegnazion di risorsis finide, o dome parcè che si vûl fâ altris ciclis dopo vê cjalât i prins. Invezit di tornâ a scomençâ, ``get_builder_resume`` al cree un builder a partî di une esecuzion precedente:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:268
msgid "The dataset, and the potentials, checkpoints and explored dataset if the previous run produced them, are taken from its outputs. The stages already reflected in them are skipped in the first loop: augmentation is not repeated, and labelling and training are skipped if potentials exist. The Quantum ESPRESSO and LAMMPS codes are taken from the previous run unless ``abinitiolabelling_code`` or ``md_code`` is passed. Other keyword arguments are forwarded to ``get_builder``."
msgstr "Il dataset, e i potenziâi, i checkpoint e il dataset esplorât se la esecuzion precedente ju à produsûts, a vegnin cjolts dai siei output. Lis fasis za rifletudis in chescj a vegnin saltadis tal prin cicli: la aumentazion no ven ripetude, e etichetadure e adestrament a vegnin saltâts se a esistin za potenziâi. I codiçs di Quantum ESPRESSO e LAMMPS a vegnin cjolts de esecuzion precedente, a mancul che no si passin ``abinitiolabelling_code`` o ``md_code``. Chei altris argoments a vegnin passâts indevant a ``get_builder``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:274
msgid "The rest of the builder (training config and codes, exploration parameters, evaluation code, scheduler options, thresholds) is not copied from the previous run. Set it again, for instance with a function shared by the first submission and the resumed ones."
msgstr "Il rest dal builder (configurazion e codiçs dal adestrament, parametris de esplorazion, codiç de valutazion, opzions dal scheduler, limits) nol ven copiât de esecuzion precedente. Torne a impostâlu, par esempli cuntune funzion condividude tra la prime mandade e chês ripiadis."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:281
msgid "Looking at the results"
msgstr "Cjalâ i risultâts"

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:295
msgid "Once the run has produced at least one committee evaluation, the plotting functions of ``aiida_trainspot.utils.plotting`` summarise how well the committee reproduces the reference data. ``plot_parity`` draws, for each completed committee evaluation, predicted against DFT energies, forces and stresses, shows a table of RMSEs and, with more than one loop, the RMSE across loops. ``detailed=True`` adds the RMSE of each potential to the table."
msgstr "Apene che la esecuzion e à produsût almancul une valutazion dal comitât, lis funzions di grafic di ``aiida_trainspot.utils.plotting`` a mostrin in curt trop ben che il comitât al riprodûs i dâts di riferiment. ``plot_parity`` al dissegne, par ogni valutazion dal comitât completade, energjiis, fuarcis e tensions dadis dai potenziâi cuintri chês DFT, al mostre une tabele di RMSE e, cun plui di un cicli, il RMSE di un cicli al altri. ``detailed=True`` al zonte ae tabele il RMSE di ogni potenziâl."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:301
msgid "``plot_error_calibration`` draws the committee deviation against the actual error. The slope of the linear fit is the factor that scales ``thr_energy``, ``thr_forces`` and ``thr_stress``."
msgstr "``plot_error_calibration`` al dissegne la deviazion dal comitât cuintri l'erôr reâl. La pendence dal fit lineâr e je il fatôr che al scjale ``thr_energy``, ``thr_forces`` e ``thr_stress``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:304
msgid "Both functions take ``cycles`` (1-based loop indices; default all completed loops), ``sets`` (a subset of ``\"training\"``, ``\"validation\"`` and ``\"test\"``), ``show`` and ``save_path``. In a notebook the figures are displayed inline. A script with these calls is `examples/plot_results.py <https://github.com/aiida-trieste-developers/aiida-trainspot/blob/main/examples/plot_results.py>`_."
msgstr "Dutis dôs lis funzions a acetin ``cycles`` (indiçs dai ciclis contâts a partî di 1; predefinît: ducj i ciclis completâts), ``sets`` (un sotinsiemi di ``\"training\"``, ``\"validation\"`` e ``\"test\"``), ``show`` e ``save_path``. Intun notebook lis figuris a vegnin mostradis dentri de pagjine. Un script cun chestis clamadis al è `examples/plot_results.py <https://github.com/aiida-trieste-developers/aiida-trainspot/blob/main/examples/plot_results.py>`_."

#: ../../source/user_guide/production_runs.rst:309
msgid "The outputs of the workchain (``dataset``, ``models_lammps``, ``models_ase``, ``RMSE``, ...) are listed in :ref:`loop-stages`."
msgstr "I output de workchain (``dataset``, ``models_lammps``, ``models_ase``, ``RMSE``, ...) a son elencâts in :ref:`loop-stages`."
